WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Narrator: Here's the ladder.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.800
Narrator: One: your supervisor first, every time.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.600
Narrator: Two: no supervisor? Report to the nearest colleague, and begin the communication chain.

4
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:28.400
Narrator: Three: if someone's life is in danger right now, don't wait - move people away, get the nearest Security, police or medical team, then report.

5
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.500
Narrator: Four: never go silent. Update when things change.

